0 BUTTERFLY / crank-driven flapping wing automaton
0 Name: butterfly.ldr
0 Author: OpenAI
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Licensed under CC BY 4.0 : see README.txt
0 // Original digital prototype; not physically built or load tested.
0 // One complete SPIKE Prime hub; one medium angular motor on portA.
0 // Home: crank up, sliderY40, wings raised53.130102degrees.
0 // One full crank revolution produces one complete flap. Cables omitted.
0 // Single physical owner per pin, axle and shared hole stack.
0 // App45601alias is body-only CAD; physical build requires complete45601c01hub.
0 // Stable IDs and port metadata follow supplied corrected examples. App execution untested.
